<p dir="auto" data-start="1471" data-end="1864"><strong data-start="1471" data-end="1492">Lưu ý quan trọng:</strong> Database mới đã bổ sung bảng <code data-start="1522" data-end="1532">dia_diem</code>, nhưng <code data-start="1540" data-end="1558">LocationDAO.java</code> hiện tại vẫn đang tìm kiếm trong <code data-start="1592" data-end="1609">dia_diem_da_luu</code>. Vì vậy để chức năng <strong data-start="1631" data-end="1677">“Tra cứu thành phố” thực sự hoạt động đúng</strong>, bước tiếp theo mình khuyên nên sửa <code data-start="1714" data-end="1732">LocationDAO.java</code> và một phần <code data-start="1745" data-end="1765">ClientHandler.java</code> để <code data-start="1769" data-end="1786">SEARCH_LOCATION</code> lấy dữ liệu từ <code data-start="1802" data-end="1812">dia_diem</code>, còn <code data-start="1818" data-end="1833">SAVE_LOCATION</code> vẫn lưu vào <code data-start="1846" data-end="1863" data-is-only-node="">dia_diem_da_luu</code>.</p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="1866" data-end="2032" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Nếu mục tiêu của bạn là <strong data-start="1890" data-end="1931"><span class="contents" data-content-reference-start="1892" data-content-reference-end="1918"><span class="entity-underline hover:entity-accent group inline cursor-pointer align-baseline whitespace-nowrap" role="button" tabindex="0"><span class="inline-flex items-center overflow-hidden align-middle" aria-hidden="true" style="opacity: 1; width: 1.5rem;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="group-hover:entity-accent icon text-token-text-primary inline-block transition-transform duration-150 ease-out group-hover:translate-x-0.5"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-bef2fe87.svg#e04414" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span><span class="group-hover:entity-accent whitespace-normal">chạy demo đồ án hoàn chỉnh</span></span></span></strong>, mình có thể tiếp tục <span class="contents" data-content-reference-start="1943" data-content-reference-end="2077"><span class="entity-underline hover:entity-accent group inline cursor-pointer align-baseline whitespace-nowrap" role="button" tabindex="0"><span class="inline-flex items-center overflow-hidden align-middle" aria-hidden="true" style="opacity: 1; width: 1.5rem;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="group-hover:entity-accent icon text-token-text-primary inline-block transition-transform duration-150 ease-out group-hover:translate-x-0.5"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-bef2fe87.svg#e04414" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span><span class="group-hover:entity-accent whitespace-normal">sửa luôn <strong data-start="9" data-end="65" node="[object Object]" class="group-hover:entity-accent">Database + LocationDAO + ClientHandler + dữ liệu mẫu</strong> thành một bộ đồng bộ để bạn chỉ cần Import DB rồi chạy Server/Client</span></span></span>. <span class="contents" data-content-reference-start="2032" data-content-reference-end="2032"><span class="align-middle" data-state="closed"><button aria-label="Trích dẫn viết mã" class="rounded-xl px-1 text-token-text-secondary bg-token-bg-tertiary hover:text-token-text-primary hover:bg-token-interactive-bg-secondary-selected"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-bef2fe87.svg#72c6a7" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></span></span></p></div></div></div><div class="w-full max-w-[480px]"><div class="border-token-border-default bg-token-bg-primary mb-2 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border"><div id="_r_f0_" class="divide-token-border-light flex flex-col divide-y"><div><div class="group/artifact-row hover:bg-token-bg-secondary/60 relative flex items-center"><button type="button" aria-label="tra_cuu_dia_ly_hoan_thien.sql" class="group/open-file peer/open-file interactive-button interactive-label-primary focus-visible:ring-token-border-heavy flex min-w-0 flex-1 cursor-pointer items-center gap-3 bg-transparent py-3 ps-4 pe-14 text-start focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-inset"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" class="size-6 shrink-0" style="color: var(--icon-primary, var(--color-text, currentColor));"><path d="M4.47037 6.27201C4.68827 5.97676 5.10453 5.91281 5.40005 6.13041C5.69558 6.34817 5.75817 6.76543 5.54068 7.06107L3.32779 10.063L5.53775 13.0122C5.75771 13.3061 5.69757 13.7227 5.40396 13.9429C5.10998 14.163 4.69343 14.1031 4.4733 13.8091L2.05728 10.5835C1.82873 10.2782 1.82711 9.85838 2.05337 9.55131L4.47037 6.27201Z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M14.6051 6.13041C14.9007 5.91281 15.3169 5.97676 15.5348 6.27201L17.9518 9.55131C18.1781 9.85838 18.1765 10.2782 17.9479 10.5835L15.5319 13.8091C15.3118 14.1031 14.8952 14.163 14.6012 13.9429C14.3076 13.7227 